		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=2707</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Last Friday started a two-day &#8220;Icons &#038; Idols: Rock n&#8217; Roll&#8221; auction with several dresses and outfits that Madonna wore [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/icons-idols-rock-n-roll-auction-madonnas-clothes-rise-3200000/20141111">&#8220;Icons &#038; Idols: Rock n&#8217; Roll&#8221; auction: Madonna&#8217;s clothes rise $3,200,000!</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Last Friday started a two-day <a href="http://www.glamourmagazine.co.uk/news/fashion/2014/11/11/madonna-auction-items-jacket-from-desperately-seeking-susan" target="_blank">&#8220;Icons &#038; Idols: Rock n&#8217; Roll&#8221;</a> auction with several dresses and outfits that <strong>Madonna</strong> wore during her music and film career. This auction raised the extraordinary amount of <strong>$3,200,000</strong>!<br />
Let&#8217;s see in particular some of the dresses:</p>
<p>the jacket Madonna wore in <strong>Desperately Seeking Susan</strong> brought in <strong>$252,000</strong>, and one earring worn in the same film fetched <strong>$34,375</strong>.<br />
The gown and stole from her <strong>Material Girl</strong> video was sold for <strong>$73,125</strong>; the wedding dress Madonna wore when she married <strong>Sean Penn</strong> in 1985 brought in <strong>$81,250</strong>.<br />
The gown from the film <strong>Evita</strong> was sold for <strong>$15,000</strong> while her baseball uniform worn in <strong>A League of Their Own</strong> fetched <strong>$31,250</strong>.</p>
<p>Now tell us <strong>Madonna</strong> is no more relevant!</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/icons-idols-rock-n-roll-auction-madonnas-clothes-rise-3200000/20141111">&#8220;Icons &#038; Idols: Rock n&#8217; Roll&#8221; auction: Madonna&#8217;s clothes rise $3,200,000!</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
