				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>&#8220;<a href="http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/madonnas-auction-clothes-highlighted-today-742488" target="_blank">Today</a>&#8221; shows some of <strong>Madonna&#8217;s</strong> clothes and memorabilia will be auctioned off as part of by Julien&#8217;s Auctions at the Icons &#038; Idols: Rock &#8216;n Roll auction in Beverly Hills.</p>
<p>The clothing highlighted included the baseball uniform Madonna wore in 1992 film <strong>A League of Their Own</strong>, as well as the dress from her <strong>Material Girl</strong> music video. A dress used in the <strong>Evita</strong> movie. The fur coat worn in the <strong>Music</strong> video. The wedding dress Madonna wore when she married <strong>Sean Penn</strong> in 1985 is estimated to sell for $<strong>40,000</strong> to $<strong>60,000</strong>.</p>
<p>The auction will begin on November 7.</p>
