		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=1844</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>We already reported about an upcoming Madonna&#8217;s auction. Now here is what Madonna&#8216;s publicist Liz Rosenberg said about it. When [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/liz-rosenberg-talks-about-madonna-auction/20140821">Liz Rosenberg talks about Madonna auction</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We already reported about an upcoming Madonna&#8217;s auction. Now here is what <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s publicist <strong>Liz Rosenberg</strong> said about it.</p>
<p>When <a title="Page Six" href="http://pagesix.com/2014/08/20/get-ready-for-the-biggest-madonna-auction-ever/" target="_blank">Page Six</a>&#8216;s Richard Johnson asked <strong>Liz Rosenberg</strong> if it was creepy that someone would own panties that <strong>Madonna</strong> worn for the V magazine cover shoot with Katy Perry, <strong>Liz</strong> replied:</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>If the shoe fits, then wear them in good health.</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p><strong>Liz</strong> added that <strong>Madonna</strong> is currently in Europe and <span style="text-decoration: underline;">unaware that the auction is taking place</span>. Furthermore, <strong>Madonna</strong> isn’t profiting from the auction.</p>
<p>“I do not believe any of what is being auctioned off was in <strong>Madonna</strong>’s possession,” <strong>Liz Rosenberg</strong> said.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Designers often supply clothes for shoots that are then returned to the designers.</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/liz-rosenberg-talks-about-madonna-auction/20140821">Liz Rosenberg talks about Madonna auction</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
